cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its results, please cite it as below."
title: "Volition: A Region-Tagged Set Transformer for Shared Choice Decoding Across the Brain-Wide Map"
abstract: >-
  Volition decodes a mouse's binary wheel choice from the pre-movement firing rates
  of recorded neurons across the IBL Brain-Wide Map. A single permutation-invariant
  set transformer, in which each neuron is a token formed from its firing rate and a
  brain-region embedding, reads sessions with different and non-overlapping neurons,
  runs in the browser, and explains each prediction with per-region attention.
